{"id":"vod_sn_36352","vodId":"36352","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"七合圣石战记","name_cn":"七合圣石战记","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a8ad203883f310b185177964d20b8abe.jpg"},"summary":"丹童子有马（寺岛拓笃 配音）是一名高中二年级的学生，看似沉默寡言严肃内向的他，其实有着一段不堪回首的过去。为了避免再伤害周围的人，有马选择了形单影只的孤独生活。某日，一位名叫蓝羽琉璃（中岛爱 配音）的少女带着执事镜诚（入野自由 配音）出现在了有马的面前，提出了希望利用有马身上“恶石”的力量。　　恶石的力量虽然强大但难以控制，有马曾因此而犯下令他追悔莫及的错误。而蓝羽琉璃则拥有“善石”的力量，能够牵制和压抑有马的暴走，在蓝羽琉璃的不断恳求下，有马终于决定走出过去的阴影敞开心扉，两人共同要面对的，是因为恶石力量而幻化而成的魔物。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UUPzwMhN5J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/74K0crEwDS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mj7WbEX9C61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7AWmGt3hCE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6m045mwFYR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nYUrMPJBS41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G56ntFDeaE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gLmL3Ez9tG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hXjuBQEWFc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KsTmQ1vwZe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qRCVygiZCW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RthR8A07MH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E0h7UYTVLV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J0daTqbTDG1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45